{"id":30298,"slug":"lucia","title":"Lucía","year":1968,"country":"Cuba","duration":160,"spine":1045,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/30298-lucia","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/d2c835969098c7bd46ae2cd81602f484/BHh2KOSkBsYNtCoEP20YT1DkdPJM14_large.jpg","description":"A formally dazzling landmark of Cuban cinema by Humberto Solás, the operatic epic Lucía recounts the history of a changing country through the eyes of three eponymous women. In 1895, Lucía is a tragic noblewoman who inadvertently betrays her country for love. In 1932, she is a member of the bourgeoisie drawn into the workers’ uprising against the dictator. And in the postrevolutionary 1960s, she is a rural newlywed struggling against patriarchal oppression. Shot in an array of distinct, evocative visual styles, Solás’s sprawling triptych is a vital document of radical progress.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Humberto Solás","slug":"humberto-solas"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Raquel Revuelta","role":"Lucía (1895)","slug":"raquel-revuelta"},{"actor":"Eduardo Moure","role":"Rafael","slug":"eduardo-moure"},{"actor":"Idalia Anreus","role":"Fernandina","slug":"idalia-anreus"},{"actor":"Eslinda Núñez","role":"Lucía (1932)","slug":"eslinda-nunez"},{"actor":"Ramón Brito","role":"Aldo","slug":"ramon-brito"},{"actor":"Flora Lauten","role":"Flora","slug":"flora-lauten"},{"actor":"Adela Legrá","role":"Lucía (196..)","slug":"adela-legra"},{"actor":"Adolfo Llauradó","role":"Tomás","slug":"adolfo-llaurado"},{"actor":"Teté Vergara","role":"Angelina","slug":"tete-vergara"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Humberto Solás","slug":"humberto-solas"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Julio García Espinosa","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Nelson Rodríguez","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Humberto Solás","slug":"humberto-solas"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Raúl Canosa","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Camilo Vives","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematogra